          "content": {
            "size": 41337,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"models\":[{\"id\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"label\":\"Claude Haiku 4.5\",\"ai_name\":\"claude\",\"description\":\"<p>Claude Haiku 4.5 is a fast model for everyday and repetitive tasks. It helps write and edit short texts, find relevant information in documents, and work with code. It is well suited to tasks where speed and consistent quality matter.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>fast responses</li><li>high-volume work</li><li>writing and coding</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":1,\"free_from_sub\":\"pro\",\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":256000,\"default_max_tokens\":16000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"label\":\"Claude Opus 5\",\"ai_name\":\"claude\",\"description\":\"<p>Claude Opus 5 is built for complex coding, analysis, and sustained work on demanding tasks. It confidently handles large codebases and extensive materials, works through multi-step tasks, and refines its outputs. An ideal choice for development, research, and professional work where accuracy and consistent quality matter.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>coding</li><li>file analysis</li><li>image analysis</li><li>multi-step task execution</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[\"pro\",\"gpt\",\"vip\",\"elite\",\"ultraelite\"],\"min_subscription\":\"pro\",\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":128000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"claude-fable-5\",\"label\":\"Claude Fable 5\",\"ai_name\":\"claude\",\"description\":\"<p>Claude Fable 5 takes on long-running autonomous projects where the path to the result can’t be fully mapped out in advance. It builds a strategy, works across tools, adjusts its approach as new information emerges and stays on course through multiple stages. It’s a strong choice for complex research, engineering workflows and open-ended problems that need to be brought to completion with minimal supervision.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>long-term planning</li><li>autonomous tool use</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[\"pro\",\"gpt\",\"vip\",\"elite\",\"ultraelite\"],\"min_subscription\":\"pro\",\"context_window\":256000,\"default_max_tokens\":32000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"claude-opus-4-6\",\"label\":\"Claude Opus 4.6\",\"ai_name\":\"claude\",\"description\":\"<p>Claude Opus 4.6 is suited to demanding professional work that requires careful analysis of large amounts of information and a precise, well-reasoned result. It helps analyse documents and data, conduct research and solve tasks with multiple requirements. It is a strong choice when depth and quality matter more than speed.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>complex analysis</li><li>extensive information review</li><li>well-reasoned solutions</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":256000,\"default_max_tokens\":32000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"claude-opus-4-7\",\"label\":\"Claude Opus 4.7\",\"ai_name\":\"claude\",\"description\":\"<p>Claude Opus 4.7 handles complex multi-step tasks involving code, tools, images and on-screen content. It follows detailed instructions closely, keeps working when a step fails and helps carry tasks through to completion. It is well suited to software development, complex document analysis and work with interfaces.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>multi-step tasks</li><li>tool use</li><li>visual analysis</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":256000,\"default_max_tokens\":32000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"claude-opus-4-8\",\"label\":\"Claude Opus 4.8\",\"ai_name\":\"claude\",\"description\":\"<p>Claude Opus 4.8 brings a careful, critical approach to demanding professional work. It examines extensive documents, visual material and data, spots inconsistencies, flags uncertainty and stays focused a