rowser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"label\":\"GPT 5.5\",\"ai_name\":\"chatgpt\",\"description\":\"<p>GPT 5.5 is designed to handle complex workflows autonomously, from the initial task to the final result. It plans the next steps, stays on track during extended work, checks intermediate outputs, and requires fewer follow-up instructions. It’s well suited for programming, research and complex projects that need to be carried through to completion step by step.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>autonomous task execution</li><li>action planning</li><li>result verification</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[\"pro\",\"gpt\",\"vip\",\"elite\",\"ultraelite\"],\"min_subscription\":\"pro\",\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":128000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gpt-5.6-luna\",\"label\":\"GPT 5.6 Luna\",\"ai_name\":\"chatgpt\",\"description\":\"<p>GPT 5.6 Luna is built for fast, high-volume processing of short, repetitive tasks. It’s well suited for summarization, information extraction and classification, translation and generation of multiple content variations. Choose it for wor